.TH SDL_ReleaseGPUTexture 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_ReleaseGPUTexture \- Frees the given texture as soon as it is safe to do so.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_ReleaseGPUTexture(
.BI "    SDL_GPUDevice *device,
.BI "    SDL_GPUTexture *texture);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
You must not reference the texture after calling this function\[char46]
.PP
It is safe to pass NULL for
.BR texture ,
in that case this function is a no-op\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I device
a GPU context\[char46]
.TP
.I texture
a texture to be destroyed\[char46]
.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

